EGORIES:\n1. Best vacation spot\n2. First pick in Draft\n3. Grossest\n4. Cutest\n5. Shiniest\n6. Best rock band name\n7. Most likely to eat a hedron\n8. Best party leader\n9. Most inept\n10. Coolest treasure\n11. Most heroic\n12. Most likely to split the party\n13. Loudest\n14. The next Planeswalker\n15. The next fad diet\n16. Best mystery novel title\n17. Best birthday gift\n18. Best win condition\n19. Worst weather\n20. Worst way to die\n21. Best flavor text\n22. Best dinner date\n23. Most likely to steal your date\n24. Best dressed\n25. Tastiest\n26. Hottest\n27. Biggest\n28. Smallest\n29. Most dangerous job\n30. Dream job\n31. Most colorful\n32. Colossal Dreadmaw's dinner\n33. Last picked in dodgeball\n34. Best pet","cardTypes":[],"colors":[],"colorIdentity":[],"keywords":[],"legalities":{"standard":"not_legal","pioneer":"not_legal","modern":"not_legal","historic":"not_legal","timeless":"not_legal","pauper":"not_legal","commander":"not_legal","brawl":"not_legal","legacy":"not_legal","vintage":"not_legal"},"imageUrl":"https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/2/5/2575442e-1422-4908-a40b-81e41a477e19.jpg?1677529512","thumbnailUrl":"https://cards.scryfall.io/small/front/2/5/2575442e-1422-4908-a40b-81e41a477e19.jpg?1677529512","power":null,"toughness":null,"isLegendary":false,"canBeCommander":false,"tags":[],"printedNames":["Strictly Better","Strictly Better (cont'd)"]},{"id":"3b0c77ab-15cd-49d8-ac5b-7b8b968d14cd","oracleId":"5a6d01c8-47b6-43e5-a6e9-c48088286007","lang":"en","name":"Strix Lookout","manaValue":2,"typeLine":"Creature — Bird","oracleText":"Flying, vigilance (Attacking doesn't cause this creature to tap.)\n{1}{U}, {T}: Draw a card, then discard a card.","cardTypes":["Creature"],"colors":["U"],"colorIdentity":["U"],"keywords":["Flying","Vigilance"],"legalities":{"standard":"legal","pioneer":"legal","modern":"legal","historic":"legal","timeless":"legal","pauper":"legal","commander":"legal","brawl":"legal","legacy":"legal","vintage":"legal"},"imageUrl":"https